{
  "$comment": "Components that ship in Lattice but that neither Cargo.lock nor package-lock.json reports. Each needs name, version, license (SPDX), copyrights, linkage and platforms ('all' or a list of target labels from scripts/foss/cargo-inventory.mjs). Linux AppImage system libraries are reviewed separately, in foss/appimage-packages.json (REQ-LTTCE-FOS-00006). The AppImage bundler parts (linkage 'separate-program': programs of their own that Lattice does not link with) carry \"appImage\": \"files\" names the paths they occupy in the unpacked AppImage, \"runtimeCommit\" the type2-runtime commit whose build recipe (src/runtime/Makefile LIBS, scripts/common/install-dependencies.sh) was reviewed for the runtime and its statically linked parts listed after it; a different commit in a built AppImage fails the gate.",
